threadcn components need two things:
1. The registry in components.json: "registries": { "@threadcn": "https://threadcn.vercel.app/r/{name}.json" }
2. A fabric background: add class="tx-fabric" to <body> (or any section). Outline, ghost and link buttons and plain text expect it.

.tx-pocket-card.background-image:
repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px),
      var(--tx-card-sheen)
